// The Edge Camp (EdgeCamp_2), the abandoned Guild outpost. Act 2 calls its climax here (bible 7.2): once Interlude A
// is decided, a notice is nailed over the old ledger. Voss is going in himself at dawn. Reading it opens the way
// from the Mirror Pool to the Threshold (`act2.threshold`, the map's gate).

title: EdgeCamp_Notice
---
<<if not has_flag("pell.report_decided")>>
    Ledger: A Guild ledger, forty-one years unposted. The last entry reads "Survey the Threshold." Unsigned. #line:0eaed88
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
<<if has_flag("act2.threshold")>>
    Notice: By order of the Guildmaster. The Threshold is closed. #still #line:075387b
    <<stop>>
<<endif>>
Notice: By order of the Guildmaster. The Threshold is closed from today. #line:0e3d003
Notice: The Guild enters it at dawn. Journeymen will stand at the line. A. Voss. #line:05b7fcc
<<if has_flag("pell.report_kept")>>
    Notice: Underneath, in a smaller hand: I'll be there after. Don't wait. P. #line:0439a43
<<endif>>
-> He's going in himself? #line:0fbd4bd
    <<voice surveyor greyfold>>
-> Then I'll be at the line. #line:01b97e9
    <<voice warden greyfold>>
-> ... #line:0a50a0b
    <<voice drift greyfold>>
<<flag act2.threshold 1>>
===
